  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the tandoor clay pot to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Mix the oats, sugar, and brown sugar in a bowl.",
    "Add the cinnamon and nutmeg to the oat mixture and stir to combine.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix the sour cream and vanilla extract.",
    "Add the eggs to the sour cream mixture and whisk until smooth.",
    "Add the oat mixture to the sour cream mixture and stir until combined.",
    "Cut the avocado in half and toast the cram slices.",
    "Assemble the bowls by placing a toasted cram slice on the bottom, followed by a layer of the oat mixture, and finally a slice of avocado.",
    "Cook the bowls in the preheated tandoor clay pot for 12 minutes.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy!"
